    "body": "That these assertions are incomplete was identified 10 years ago by the person who implemented `template` for Gecko, but as a reviewer I failed to notice that a spec bug needed filing. Sorry! (Or perhaps the `template` stuff hadn't been merged to the main spec at that point in time?)\r\n\r\nI think that instead of merely removing the assertion, it would be more helpful to update the assertion to say \"fragment case or there is a `template` element on the stack\" (which is how the assertion was update in Gecko).",
